{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-64-1","title":"Isaiah 64:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The church prays for the illustration of God's power. 4 Celebrating God's mercy, it makes confession of their natural corruptions. 9 It complains of their afflictions.</p>\n<p>Oh that. Ps 18:7-15; 144:5,6; Mr 1:10; *marg: that thou wouldest come. 63:15; Ex 3:8; 19:11,18,19; Mic 1:3,4; Hab 3:1-13 that the. Jud 5:4,5; Ps 46:6; 68:8; 114:4-7; Am 9:5,13; Na 1:5,6; 2Pe 3:10-12 Re 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-2","title":"Isaiah 64:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>melting fire. Heb. fire of meltings. to make. 37:20; 63:12; Ex 14:4; 1Sa 17:46,47; 1Ki 8:41-43; Ps 46:10; 67:1,2 Ps 79:10; 83:13; 98:1,2; 102:15,16; 106:8; Eze 38:22,23; 39:27,28 Da 4:1-3,32-37; 6:25-27; Joe 3:16,17 that the nations. Ex 15:14-16; De 2:25; Ps 9:20; 48:4-6; 99:1; Jer 5:22; 33:9 Mic 7:15-17; Re 11:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-3","title":"Isaiah 64:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>thou didst. Ex 34:10; De 4:34; 10:21; Jud 5:4,5; 2Sa 7:23; Ps 65:6; 66:3,5; 68:8 Ps 76:12; 105:27-36; 106:22 the mountains. 1; Hab 3:3,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-4","title":"Isaiah 64:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>have not. Ps 31:19; 1Co 2:9,10; Eph 3:5-10,17-21; Col 1:26,27; 1Ti 3:16 1Jo 3:1,2; 4:10; Re 21:1-4,22-24; 22:1-5 seen, etc. or, seen a God besides thee, which doeth so for,etc. prepared. Ps 31:19; Mt 25:34; Joh 14:3; Heb 11:16 waiteth. 25:9; Ge 49:18; Ps 62:1; 130:5; La 3:25,26; Lu 2:25; Ro 8:19,23-25 1Co 1:7; 1Th 1:10; Jas 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-5","title":"Isaiah 64:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>meetest. Ex 20:24; 25:22; 29:42,43; 30:6; Heb 4:16 rejoiceth. Ps 25:10; 37:4; 112:1; Ac 10:2-4,35; Php 3:13-15 those that. 26:8,9; 56:1-7 thou art wroth. 63:10; Ps 90:7-9 in those. Ps 103:17; Jer 31:18-20; Ho 6:3; 11:8; Mal 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-6","title":"Isaiah 64:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>are all. 6:5; 53:6; Job 14:4; 15:14-16; 25:4; 40:4; 42:5,6; Ps 51:5 Ro 7:18,24; Eph 2:1,2; Tit 3:3 all our. 57:12; Zec 3:3; Php 3:9; Re 3:17,18; 7:13 we all. 40:6-8; Ps 90:5,6; Jas 1:10,11; 1Pe 1:24,25 our iniquities. 57:13; Ps 1:4; Jer 4:11,12; Ho 4:19; Zec 5:8-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-7","title":"Isaiah 64:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>there is. 50:2; 59:16; Ps 14:4; Eze 22:30; Ho 7:7,14 to take. 27:5; 56:4 hast hid. 57:17; 59:2; De 31:17; 32:19-25; Ho 5:15 consumed. Heb. melted. Jer 9:7; Eze 22:18-22; 24:11 because. Heb. by the hand, as Job 8:4; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-8","title":"Isaiah 64:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>thou art. 63:16; Ex 4:22; De 32:6; Ga 3:26,29 are the clay. 29:16; 45:9; Jer 18:2-6; Ro 9:20-24 all are. 43:7; 44:21,24; Job 10:8,9; Ps 100:3; 119:73; 138:8; Eph 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-9","title":"Isaiah 64:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>wroth. Ps 6:1; 38:1; 74:1,2; 79:5-9; Jer 10:24; Hab 3:2 remember. Jer 3:12; La 5:20; Mic 7:18-20; Mal 1:4; 2Pe 2:17; Re 20:10 we are. 63:19; Ps 79:13; 119:94</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-10","title":"Isaiah 64:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>1:7; 2Ki 25:9; 2Ch 36:19-21; Ps 79:1-7; La 1:1-4; 2:4-8; 5:18 Da 9:26,27; 12:7; Mic 3:12; Lu 21:21,24; Re 11:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-11","title":"Isaiah 64:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>holy. 2Ki 25:9; 2Ch 36:19; Ps 74:5-7; Jer 52:13; La 2:7; Eze 7:20,21 Eze 24:21,25; Mt 24:2 where. 1Ki 8:14,56; 2Ch 6:4; 7:3,6; 29:25-30 all our. La 1:7,10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-64-12","title":"Isaiah 64:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":64,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":64,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>42:14; Ps 10:1; 74:10,11,18,19; 79:5; 80:3,4; 83:1; 89:46-51 Zec 1:12; Re 6:10</p>"}]}